uld exclude; processed anyway per the 3.5 warning precedent (zero skipped-financial rows exist and financial-sector concalls are being logged done) - owner decision still open.","st":[{"status":"Unthemed","subtheme":"General – Payments & Fintech Infrastructure - enterprise merchant acquiring / payment gateway (CCAvenue) + e-commerce platform software + consumer internet (Rediff) + emerging embedded-finance distribution. NOTE: metadata classes this name Financial Services / Financial Technology (Fintech), which the literal SPEC 3.5 SECTOR SKIP RULE would exclude; processed anyway per the 3.5 warning precedent (zero skipped-financial rows exist and financial-sector concalls are being logged done) - owner decision still open.","tag":"General","theme":"Infrastructure, Construction & Real Estate","tier":""}],"thesis":"AvenuesAI (ex-Infibeam Avenues) re-badged itself this quarter from a payment gateway into an \"AI-first financial infrastructure and transaction intelligence platform,\" and FY26 headline growth is spectacular only at the gross line, i.e. the growth is TPV pass-through, not monetisation. The real Q4 news is strategic, not financial: a declared asset-light pivot into embedded lending via **minority NBFC stakes** and a **proposed strategic investment in Online PSB Loans announced on the call day**, plus a **confidential DRHP filed for Rediff**. Management explicitly withheld FY27 guidance (\"we'll give guidance in the first quarter call for the full year\"), pre-empted a profit re-rating (\"we don't see a hockey stick in FY '27 in profitability\"), and, unusually, conceded its prior AI/US thesis was mistimed: \"yes, we were wrong in terms of thinking that AI adoption in such large financial enterprises will become much cleaner, faster.\"","trig":[]},"lm":"","m":5407,"mem":0,"pdd":"","prev_stage":1,"prev_zone_vpe":-1.2,"r":null,"s":"CCAVENUE","sig":"","sx":{"SMA_50":"16.4","base_count":"","drawdown_from_prev_signal":"","duration_from_prev_signal":"","pct_below_52w_high":"23.0","pct_change_from_prev_signal":"","pivot_close":"","pivot_low":"","stage_changed_since_prev_signal":"","vpe_df_60d_sum":"-1.2","vpe_zone_cumul_df":""},"t":""}},"s":"CCAVENUE"}